{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xentra Station</strong> is a retro-inspired 2D shooting game set in a mysterious and atmospheric futuristic world. You will navigate a top-secret research station and venture into other exotic, locations hidden deep underground. Each environment is filled with danger, secrets, forgotten experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will uncover powerful suit upgrades, unlock unique abilities, and acquire a variety of specialized weapons and tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are packed with hidden passages, alternate routes, and secrets, rewarding those who take the time to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic '90s 2D and early 3D shooters, <i>Xentra Station</i> blends old-school action with modern gameplay elements, creating an experience that feels both nostalgic and fresh. Prepare for fast-paced combat, exploration, and a thrilling adventure that will test your skill and curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503310?t=1755186226","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503310?t=1755186226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503310/6807276d537aec941b197275317ef213d864acd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755186226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503310/6807276d537aec941b197275317ef213d864acd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755186226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xentra Station</strong> is a retro-inspired 2D shooting game set in a mysterious and atmospheric futuristic world. You wi